Package: SegreCP
Type: Package
Title: Riemannian CP Tensor Estimation on the Segre Manifold
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ke", "Xu", email = "kxu6@nd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yuefeng", "Han", email = "yuefeng.han@nd.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements Riemannian gradient descent and Riemannian
    Gauss-Newton algorithms for noisy low-CP-rank tensor decomposition,
    scalar-on-tensor regression, and tensor-on-tensor regression. The package
    uses exact rank-(1,...,1) truncated higher-order singular value
    decomposition retractions, provides Composite PCA and HOSVD
    initializations, and accepts both base R arrays and 'rTensor' Tensor
    objects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kxu-stat/SegreCP, https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.00569
BugReports: https://github.com/kxu-stat/SegreCP/issues
